## UI test constraints

- **`data-testid`: none** — prefer role/text + shared helpers (`DateRangePickerComponent`, `AppSidebarPage` group/tab API)
- Selectors: Ukrainian text, placeholders, shadcn `data-slot` — fragile; avoid Tailwind class chains
- **RBAC:** sidebar items gated by permissions; write actions blocked when «Всі локації» selected
- Locale: Ukrainian throughout

