Login Keycloak selectors and post-login `/production` — correct for typical production VIEW.

## erp-auto-test UI coverage

Broad Playwright coverage across production, relocation, inventory, global plans, tech maps, users, defects, equipment — see `src/test/java/com/erp/tests/ui/` and suites `ui.xml` / `ui-dev.xml` / domain suites.

When adding UI tests: prefer `data-testid` in tk-ui first, then Page Objects in `com.erp.pages`.
